# go-secrets import (security/secrets): test fixtures first added in the original MVP commit f7c3127; owner-reviewed 2026-10-15; no operational credentials.
secret-assignment security/secrets/credfile/credfile_test.go Test-authored constant in a unit test, not obtained from a credential store.
home-path-linux security/secrets/ref_test.go Placeholder user directory in a reference-parser test, not a real user path.
credentials-in-url security/secrets/resolver_test.go Made-up connection string with user info on a placeholder host, fed to a redaction test.
